{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our facility! Here, you\u2019ll experience the thrill of strategic duels: block attacks, acquire ammo, and shoot your opponent. We hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are similar to rock, paper, scissors: Both players make decisions at the same time. They have three options: block, get ammo, and shoot. In order to shoot, the player needs to get ammo first, but if the opponent shoots when the player gets ammo, the player gets shot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends or Strangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.poster.avif?t=1765901197\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.webm?t=1765901197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.mp4?t=1765901197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends or use  matchmaking to connect with other  <span class=\"bb_strike\">nasty</span> friendly guests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.poster.avif?t=1765901197\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.webm?t=1765901197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.mp4?t=1765901197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the upper hand with powerful ability cards that can turn the tide of any duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Edit Your Face</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.poster.avif?t=1765901197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.webm?t=1765901197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We understand the importance of self-expression. Customize your helmet and show the world your true face, or at least the one you want to show.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Voluntary Exit Initiative","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301930/d9fae7c9cd487698545b0c03618a6597bd465870.jpg"},{"name":"Training Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301930/d9fae7c9cd487698545b0c03618a6597bd465870.jpg"},{"name":"One Step Closer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301930/d9fae7c9cd487698545b0c03618a6597bd465870.jpg"},{"name":"Touch Grass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301930/d9fae7c9cd487698545b0c03618a6597bd465870.jpg"},{"name":"It's Just a Hobby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301930/d9fae7c9cd487698545b0c03618a6597bd465870.jpg"},{"name":"Pee-ter Pan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301930/d9fae7c9cd487698545b0c03618a6597bd465870.jpg